     "ar": [
      12,
      16
     ],
     "en": "give us full measure and be charitable to us"
    },
    {
     "line": 2,
     "v": 58,
     "ar": [
      5,
      8
     ],
     "en": "he recognized them, but he was to them unknown"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "v": 3,
     "ar": [
      3,
      4
     ],
     "en": "the best of stories"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "title": "From the Well to the Throne",
     "sub": "The Complete Story of Hazrat Yusuf (AS)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Dream of Eleven Stars",
   "scene": "dream",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "v": 4,
     "ar": [
      4,
      14
     ],
     "en": "O my father, indeed I have seen [in a dream] eleven stars and the sun and the moon; I saw them prostrating to me"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 5,
     "ar": [
      0,
      9
     ],
     "en": "O my son, do not relate your vision to your brothers or they will contrive against you a plan"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "v": 6,
     "ar": [
      0,
      2
     ],
     "en": "And thus will your Lord choose you"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Well",
   "scene": "well",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "v": 10,
     "ar": [
      3,
      9
     ],
     "en": "Do not kill Joseph but throw him into the bottom of the well"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 13,
     "ar": [
      6,
      12
     ],
     "en": "I fear that a wolf would eat him while you are of him unaware"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 15,
     "ar": [
      9,
      16
     ],
     "en": "You will surely inform them [someday] about this affair of theirs while they do not perceive"
    },
    {
     "line": 10,
     "v": 18,
     "ar": [
      0,
      4
     ],
     "en": "And they brought upon his shirt false blood"
    },
    {
     "line": 11,
     "v": 18,
     "ar": [
      11,
      14
     ],
     "en": "so patience is most fitting. And Allah is the one sought for help"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Sold for a Few Coins",
   "scene": "caravan",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 2,
     "v": 20,
     "ar": [
      0,
      4
     ],
     "en": "they sold him for a reduced price - a few dirhams"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "v": 21,
     "ar": [
      23,
      31
     ],
     "en": "And Allah is predominant over His affair, but most of the people do not know"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Closed Doors",
   "scene": "doors",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "v": 23,
     "ar": [
      7,
      8
     ],
     "en": "She closed the doors"
    },
    {
     "line": 1,
     "v": 23,
     "ar": [
      12,
      14
     ],
     "en": "[I seek] the refuge of Allah"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 27,
     "ar": [
      0,
      9
     ],
     "en": "But if his shirt is torn from the back, then she has lied, and he is of the truthful"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Women of the City",
   "scene": "banquet",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 31,
     "ar": [
      19,
      20
     ],
     "en": "and cut their hands"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "v": 33,
     "ar": [
      0,
      7
     ],
     "en": "My Lord, prison is more to my liking than that to which they invite me"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Prison and Two Dreams",
   "scene": "prison",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 5,
     "v": 39,
     "ar": [
      0,
      8
     ],
     "en": "O [my] two companions of prison, are separate lords better or Allah, the One, the Prevailing"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 42,
     "ar": [
      6,
      8
     ],
     "en": "Mention me before your master"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The King's Dream",
   "scene": "cows",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "v": 43,
     "ar": [
      2,
      14
     ],
     "en": "Indeed, I have seen [in a dream] seven fat cows being eaten by seven [that were] lean, and seven green spikes [of grain] and others [that were] dry"
    },
    {
     "line": 8,
     "text": "7 years of plenty · 7 years of hardship · then rain",
     "ref": "Yusuf 12:47–49"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "From Prison to the Storehouses",
   "scene": "granary",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 51,
     "ar": [
      19,
      28
     ],
     "en": "Now the truth has become evident. It was I who sought to seduce him, and indeed, he is of the truthful"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "v": 55,
     "ar": [
      0,
      7
     ],
     "en": "Appoint me over the storehouses of the land. Indeed, I will be a knowing guardian"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 56,
     "ar": [
      13,
      16
     ],
     "en": "We do not allow to be lost the reward of those who do good"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Brothers and the Golden Cup",
   "scene": "store",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 64,
     "ar": [
      11,
      16
     ],
     "en": "But Allah is the best guardian, and He is the most merciful of the merciful"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "v": 69,
     "ar": [
      8,
      15
     ],
     "en": "Indeed, I am your brother, so do not despair over what they used to do"
    },
    {
     "line": 8,
     "text": "Hazrat Yusuf's (AS) brother, known as *Binyamin*",
     "ref": "Yusuf 12:76"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "“I Only Complain to Allah”",
   "scene": "home",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 83,
     "ar": [
      6,
      13
     ],
     "en": "so patience is most fitting. Perhaps Allah will bring them to me all together"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "v": 86,
     "ar": [
      0,
      12
     ],
     "en": "I only complain of my suffering and my grief to Allah, and I know from Allah that which you do not know"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 87,
     "ar": [
      6,
      10
     ],
     "en": "despair not of relief from Allah"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "“I Am Yusuf”",
   "scene": "reveal",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "v": 89,
     "ar": [
      1,
      9
     ],
     "en": "Do you know what you did with Joseph and his brother when you were ignorant"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "v": 90,
     "ar": [
      4,
      8
     ],
     "en": "I am Joseph, and this is my brother"
    },
    {
     "line": 11,
     "v": 92,
     "ar": [
      1,
      10
     ],
     "en": "No blame will there be upon you today. Allah will forgive you; and He is the most merciful of the merciful"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Third Shirt",
   "scene": "shirt",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "v": 93,
     "ar": [
      0,
      8
     ],
     "en": "Take this, my shirt, and cast it over the face of my father; he will become seeing"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "v": 96,
     "ar": [
      9,
      19
     ],
     "en": "Did I not tell you that I know from Allah that which you do not know"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "v": 100,
     "ar": [
      8,
      17
     ],
     "en": "O my father, this is the explanation of my vision of before. My Lord has made it reality"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The Lesson",
   "scene": "lesson",
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 2,
     "v": 111,
     "ar": [
      0,
      6
     ],
     "en": "There was certainly in their stories a lesson for those of understanding"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "end": true
    }
   ]
  }
